{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411430","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411430","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241143001:1":{"text":"Sonja, peaceful days have returned to Rustport after you defeated the Dead Tide Fleet. What's next for you?","source_cn":"索尼娅，击败死潮舰队，锈锚港恢复平静之后，你有什么计划呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E6E8F4F741BA85D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241143002:1":{"text":"No, I'm not trying to pry into the Carmine Whispers' secrets! I'm just curious about what the future holds for Rustport.","source_cn":"我不是想打探血薇帮的机密！只是有点好奇，当一切恢复平静...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0DA81E85B15FA08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241143003:1":{"text":"Rustport's been hit hard by this lockdown. I'll focus on getting the commercial activities and logistics here back on track first.","source_cn":"……锈锚港在这次封锁中元气大伤，我会着手恢复锈锚港的贸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED5BDEA910143DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241143004:1":{"text":"About the people here being aggressive...","source_cn":"那么锈锚港的民风问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6608C6A31480EF63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241143005:1":{"text":"That's our way of life.","source_cn":"那是我们的生活方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC459146F3B3BB546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241143006:1":{"text":"Actually, things are already much better than before.","source_cn":"而且，现在比起之前，已经好了太多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27777192223292B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241143007:1":{"text":"This place used to be full of orphans a long, long time ago.","source_cn":"很久以前，这里有很多孤儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF644CDFE73734FE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241143008:1":{"text":"Flocks of merchants came and went, pirates were rampant, taverns were always full, and the inns stayed open all night long.","source_cn":"因为来往的商旅很多，附近海盗猖獗，酒水生意红火，旅馆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53D0524E38C3AD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241143009:1":{"text":"At that time, orphans with no names were as numerous as the stones on the shore.","source_cn":"那时候，没有名字的孤儿像海边石头一样多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A72A975E1AEAEEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241143010:1":{"text":"You'd see all kinds of corpses down the road every day.","source_cn":"走在路上，每天都能发现各种死状的尸体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8ADF95C0B522475","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241143011:1":{"text":"That's just... dreadful!","source_cn":"这、这也太可怕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26358A08482EADFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241143012:1":{"text":"Nara and I were one of those orphans.","source_cn":"我和奈拉就是在那种环境下长大的孤儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD099363EC8DB2C86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241143013:1":{"text":"I was really reluctant to take on a burden since she wasn't my biological sister.","source_cn":"她不是我的亲妹妹，我本来也不想带着一个累赘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE72070580B084D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241143014:1":{"text":"But... she stuck onto me like a tail I could never get rid of. Eventually, I just stopped wanting her to go.","source_cn":"但……她像个甩不掉的尾巴。直到我再也不想甩下她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE941185B558452A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241143015:1":{"text":"Nara must have been an adorable girl back then, right?","source_cn":"那时候的奈拉，一定很可爱吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10C6D3C7431764FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241143016:1":{"text":"Got it...","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1241143016":{"text":"Got it...","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241143017:1":{"text":"No worries. I'm confident she won't die that easily.","source_cn":"没关系。我相信她不会轻易死去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x798F07E8D9F6229E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241143018:1":{"text":"Didn't you hear her? She vowed to come back for me even if she sank to the bottom of the sea...","source_cn":"你没听到她说的吗？就算沉入海底，她都要爬回来找我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x115DD3390C997FA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Didn't you hear her? She vowed to come back for me even if she sank to the bottom of the sea...","female":"Didn't you hear her? She vowed to come back for me even if she sank to the bottom of the sea...","variant_male_record_index":"137915","variant_female_record_index":"137916","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241143019:1":{"text":"Sonja...","source_cn":"索尼娅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6FBB2BA2BF986B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241143020:1":{"text":"I believe she'll be back, and I'll wait for her here.","source_cn":"我相信她会回来的，我就在这等着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA6F1539BD4766A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241143021:1":{"text":"No matter how long it takes.","source_cn":"无论要等多久，我都会等她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0356EFB0E7555E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1241143022:1":{"text":"But there are things in Rustport that I have to take care of first.","source_cn":"在那之前，我必须把锈锚港的事情处理好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2397DFE13FF1912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1241143023:1":{"text":"I'll make sure no children in Rustport suffer the same tragic fate as ours.","source_cn":"我不允许这里再出现命运和我们一样悲惨的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D934D33847459E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1241143024:1":{"text":"That's what drives me to take the helm here.","source_cn":"这也是我决心管理锈锚港的初衷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21F3AED4C262B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"Sorry for bringing up your painful memories.","source_cn":"勾起了你的伤心事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF41E636677C1E6BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sorry for bringing up your painful memories.","female":"Sorry for bringing up your painful memories.","variant_male_record_index":"67084","variant_female_record_index":"67085","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"Cheer up!","source_cn":"振作一点吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEBB9ABBF420C3D96","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Cheer up!","female":"Cheer up!","variant_male_record_index":"67086","variant_female_record_index":"67087","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":27,"speaker_count":2}}